# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# This repo is PUBLIC. It has to be: jsDelivr only serves public repos, and the
# booking site pulls its stylesheet, header, footer and JS from here. Anything
# committed is world-readable and stays in the history. Keep client data out.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Local analytics scratch: GA4 exports, working xlsx and the scripts that build
# them. Client data, so it stays local.
Analytics/

# Hotel ID database - the raw Revelex export (~85MB), read by
# tools/build-hotel-index.py. Never commit it, it would bloat the repo.
tools/GTCHotels.csv

# Generated by tools/build-hotel-index.py: ~13k shard files, ~134MB on disk.
# Rebuild with `python3 build-hotel-index.py` from inside tools/.
tools/deploy/
tools/deploy.zip

# Local Netlify link state
tools/.netlify

# Old locations, kept so a stale working copy cannot commit them by accident.
GTCHotels.csv
deploy/
deploy.zip
.netlify
